<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντηχ-έω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντηχ-ᾱχέω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			4.11
		</span></i>(Scal.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sing
				in answer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιᾶνα θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					423
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντάχησ᾽ ἂν ὕμνον ἀρσένων
				γέννᾳ</span> would <i>have sung</i> a song <i>in answer
				to . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Med.</u>
				426
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>sound responsively,</i> of a musical string, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				919b16
			</span></i>; of bronze vessels, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				37.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				22.11.12
			</span></i>; <i>resound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.56
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Carn.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				1.38
			</span></i>; <i>echo,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωναῖς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.414c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>shout in opposition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.19.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				21.255d
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>contradict,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.925e
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				1000c
			</span></i>.</div>
